{"id":"n36862-3-9","stage":4,"title":"굳히다 · 坚定","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36862-3-9-1","ko":"나 유학 가기로 마음을 굳혔어.","zh":"我决定要去留学了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유학","meaning":"留学","explanation":"유학：留学","readings":[{"term":"유학","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70244","senseId":"1","lemma":"유학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가기로","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마음을","meaning":"心思，心意，意向","explanation":"마음：心思，心意，意向；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"5","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"굳혔어.","meaning":"坚定，坚决","explanation":"굳히다：坚定，坚决；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"굳히다","audio":"/audio/d2bd292fd52482c8de07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36862","senseId":"3","lemma":"굳히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4c52a19db898d399","term":"유학","zh":"留学","audio":"/audio/4c52a19db898d399dde7.mp3","entryId":"70244","definition":"在外国生活并学习。","pronunciation":["유학"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心思，心意，意向","audio":"/audio/aa9